#: docs/examples/catalog-analytics.md
msgid "The search form, game list and game details each connect to the same $$search model through their own holo. Each View subscribes only to the values it displays. Analytics is attached once to the model: additional View owners share the connection, so one fact produces one delivery per selected engine. Removing one View leaves observation active until the final owner releases it."
msgstr "The search form, game list and game details each connect to the same $$search model through their own holo. Each View subscribes only to the values it displays. Analytics is attached once to the model: additional View owners share the connection, so one fact produces one delivery per selected engine. Removing one View leaves observation active until the final owner releases it."

