#: docs/guide/business-logic.md
msgid "Write the sequence in business terms: validate the draft, capture the submitted values, request a save, accept the response, publish that the gift order was saved. A command expresses an intention and can fail. A fact describes something that has already happened; publish it only after the relevant operation succeeds."
msgstr "Write the sequence in business terms: validate the draft, capture the submitted values, request a save, accept the response, publish that the gift order was saved. A command expresses an intention and can fail. A fact describes something that has already happened; publish it only after the relevant operation succeeds."

