msgid "In domain modelling, an event commonly already means a fact that occurred. Here the useful distinction is intention versus occurrence: search is a command; searchCompleted reports its result. The payload should contain the business context needed by its consumers at that moment, rather than forcing them to reconstruct history from mutable current state."
msgstr "In domain modelling, an event commonly already means a fact that occurred. Here the useful distinction is intention versus occurrence: search is a command; searchCompleted reports its result. The payload should contain the business context needed by its consumers at that moment, rather than forcing them to reconstruct history from mutable current state."

#. Markdown. Preserve links, inline code and table/list syntax.
