msgid "The search fact carries the query, category, result count and duration. Capture request context before await in a real asynchronous search. If ordering or correlation matters, also define an operation ID, occurrence time or revision. Keep payloads immutable and limited to the permitted business data; do not copy an entire model or personal data just in case."
msgstr "The search fact carries the query, category, result count and duration. Capture request context before await in a real asynchronous search. If ordering or correlation matters, also define an operation ID, occurrence time or revision. Keep payloads immutable and limited to the permitted business data; do not copy an entire model or personal data just in case."

