msgid "Analytics translates facts into engine-specific messages. Keep provider names, field renaming and unit conversions in that consumer, so changing an engine does not change the business model. [The analytics topic](/topics/analytics) shows the mappings and explains when lazy observation begins, what its delivery queue preserves and which early facts it cannot capture."
msgstr "Analytics translates facts into engine-specific messages. Keep provider names, field renaming and unit conversions in that consumer, so changing an engine does not change the business model. [The analytics topic](/topics/analytics) shows the mappings and explains when lazy observation begins, what its delivery queue preserves and which early facts it cannot capture."

