#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: docs/reference/createAmplitudeAdapter.md
msgid "createAmplitudeAdapter(client) returns `AnalyticsAdapter<AmplitudeMessage>`. Each message contains name and properties. The client supplies track and flush methods compatible with the exported AmplitudeClient interface. The package does not import or initialize the SDK."
msgstr "createAmplitudeAdapter(client) returns `AnalyticsAdapter<AmplitudeMessage>`. Each message contains name and properties. The client supplies track and flush methods compatible with the exported AmplitudeClient interface. The package does not import or initialize the SDK."

#. Markdown. Preserve links, inline code and table/list syntax.
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: docs/reference/createAmplitudeAdapter.md
msgid "send hands the message to track without waiting for network ingestion. Rejected receipts and non-200 receipt codes report through the analytics context. flush awaits the SDK flush receipt. An aborted send is ignored before handoff; an accepted SDK operation is not cancelled."
msgstr "send hands the message to track without waiting for network ingestion. Rejected receipts and non-200 receipt codes report through the analytics context. flush awaits the SDK flush receipt. An aborted send is ignored before handoff; an accepted SDK operation is not cancelled."

#. Markdown. Preserve links, inline code and table/list syntax.
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: docs/reference/createAmplitudeAdapter.md
msgid "Application code owns initialization, user identity and consent. The adapter handles event transport only. Other engines keep their own message types and mappings."
msgstr "Application code owns initialization, user identity and consent. The adapter handles event transport only. Other engines keep their own message types and mappings."

