msgstr "Projections describe the latest started call. Every call keeps its own Promise. If the second call completes before the first, pending becomes false and the second result remains visible after the first finishes. Pending is not an aggregate count of unfinished saves."

#. Markdown. Preserve links, inline code and table/list syntax.
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: docs/reference/createMutationModel.md
msgid "Reset clears observed data, error, and variables. Already started requests and native options callbacks continue. New calls observe new executions; old completions cannot overwrite their state."
msgstr "Reset clears observed data, error, and variables. Already started requests and native options callbacks continue. New calls observe new executions; old completions cannot overwrite their state."

