#. Markdown. Preserve links, inline code and table/list syntax.
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: docs/reference/createQueryModel.md
msgid "Declaration creates no observer. A read may create an observer and query-cache entry but does not subscribe or fetch. The first mounted projection subscribes; sibling projections share that observer. The last unsubscribe removes it from the query. Query-core owns cancellation and cache `gcTime`. Remount rebinds before subscribing, including after the cache entry expires."
msgstr "Declaration creates no observer. A read may create an observer and query-cache entry but does not subscribe or fetch. The first mounted projection subscribes; sibling projections share that observer. The last unsubscribe removes it from the query. Query-core owns cancellation and cache `gcTime`. Remount rebinds before subscribing, including after the cache entry expires."

#. Markdown. Preserve links, inline code and table/list syntax.
