#: docs/reference/defineModel.md
msgid "Import defineModel from `jotai-holo/model`. It returns the same function without calling or wrapping it. Declaration creates no atoms, instances, subscriptions or registry. Each direct factory call creates the record described by your factory."
msgstr "Import defineModel from `jotai-holo/model`. It returns the same function without calling or wrapping it. Declaration creates no atoms, instances, subscriptions or registry. Each direct factory call creates the record described by your factory."

#. Markdown. Preserve links, inline code and table/list syntax.
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: docs/reference/defineModel.md
msgid "TypeScript requires a synchronous object result and rejects Promise results. The helper preserves optional parameters and generic signatures; it does not inspect the returned fields or enforce purity at runtime. Keep subscriptions, I/O and hooks outside the factory. For composition with model modifiers, pass creation data through one initial argument."
msgstr "TypeScript requires a synchronous object result and rejects Promise results. The helper preserves optional parameters and generic signatures; it does not inspect the returned fields or enforce purity at runtime. Keep subscriptions, I/O and hooks outside the factory. For composition with model modifiers, pass creation data through one initial argument."

#. Markdown. Preserve links, inline code and table/list syntax.
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: docs/reference/defineModel.md
msgid "Use defineModel to make a factory's role explicit without adding behavior. A plain named function works equally well. Add modelRegistry only when you need shared instance selection; apply other modifiers for their own responsibilities. This helper adds no lifetime management and does not change atom semantics."
msgstr "Use defineModel to make a factory's role explicit without adding behavior. A plain named function works equally well. Add modelRegistry only when you need shared instance selection; apply other modifiers for their own responsibilities. This helper adds no lifetime management and does not change atom semantics."

