msgstr "Dirty snapshots save on last release. Writes are serialized per instance. Await definition.flush(store, { key }) or lease.flush() when completion matters; flush does not activate a cold model. Background failures reach onError; explicit flush rejects. Operations time out after 10 seconds by default. Cancellation requires the transport to honor AbortSignal."

